/* ~~~~ CONTENT OF COLORS-DARK ~~~~~

ArcticWorks Design palette (dark, official @arcticworks/design tokens):
  surface 0-3 = neutral 975/950/925/900 (#0B0B0D · #111114 · #17171B · #1D1D22)
  text primary #F2F2F4 · secondary #A8A8B0 · tertiary #7A7A84
  border subtle #1D1D22 · default #2C2C33 · strong #3A3A42
  interactive default #3D8BFF · hover #5C9CFF · primary #2B6FD9 · active #245BC2
  status: success #3FB950 · warning #E3B341 · danger #F04A4A
See docs/ARCTICWORKS_THEME.md.

1.BASEMAP
2.BOUNDARY
3.NATURAL
  3.1 Main natural
  3.2 Vegetation
4.LANDUSE
  4.1 Main landuse
  4.2 Aerodrome
  4.3 Barriers
  4.4 Buildings
5.ROADS
  5.1 All roads
  5.2 Bridges
  5.3 Tunnels
  5.4 Piste
  5.5 Transport
 6.LABELS COLORS
  6.1 Main labels
  6.2 Natural labels
  6.3 Place labels
  6.4 Road labels
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*/

/* 1.BASEMAP */

@background0: #0B0B0D;
